    "detailed_description": "<i>The following is a series of tapes recovered near the Overlook National Park where four people were recently reported missing- a family of three and one motorist.</i><br><br>OWLMAN is a retro-stylized, first-person horror game played through the lens of a motorist documenting their favorite getaway. As they proceed back down the mountain and the sun starts to set, it becomes clear something is wrong.<br>Explore an atmospheric open-world forest and evade the OWLMAN, among other threats.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VHS</strong>, retro aesthetic.<br></li><li><strong>Linear</strong> story taking place across a series of tapes.<br></li><li><strong>Infinite Chase Mode</strong>: See how long you can evade the Owlman and explore the <strong>open world</strong> without the constraints of a narrative.</li></ul><br><i>OWLMAN is not a you-die-you-lose sort of game. It is sometimes necessary that the characters in the narrative meet their intended fates.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>The following is a series of tapes recovered near the Overlook National Park where four people were recently reported missing- a family of three and one motorist.</i><br><br>OWLMAN is a retro-stylized, first-person horror game played through the lens of a motorist documenting their favorite getaway. As they proceed back down the mountain and the sun starts to set, it becomes clear something is wrong.<br>Explore an atmospheric open-world forest and evade the OWLMAN, among other threats.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VHS</strong>, retro aesthetic.<br></li><li><strong>Linear</strong> story taking place across a series of tapes.<br></li><li><strong>Infinite Chase Mode</strong>: See how long you can evade the Owlman and explore the <strong>open world</strong> without the constraints of a narrative.</li></ul><br><i>OWLMAN is not a you-die-you-lose sort of game. It is sometimes necessary that the characters in the narrative meet their intended fates.</i>",
